{
  "name": "Meeting transcript to action items",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Transcript to action items\n\n1. Attach OpenAI, Slack, and Google Sheets credentials.\n2. Set the spreadsheet id, sheet name, and Slack channel in Config.\n3. Sheet headers: Title, Attendees, Summary, Decisions, Task, Owner, DueDate, Priority.\n4. One sheet row is written per action item. A meeting with no actions still writes one row so the summary is kept.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0fbe9b4a-0d12-4cd3-b919-add8bbc123bb",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "meeting-actions",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
